# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads for the cv-service image
# (deploy/deploy-cv-service-cloudrun.sh). Without this file gcloud falls
# back to .gitignore, which drops cv-service/models/ — the image would ship
# without its weights. Whitelist only what cv-service/Dockerfile copies;
# .dockerignore then filters the build context the same way.
/*
!/.dockerignore
!/cv-service/
!/assets/

# Never upload: real-photo intake / labels (may contain photos of real
# servicemembers), bulky training output, local caches.
/cv-service/data/real_photos/
/cv-service/data/labels/
/cv-service/synthetic_data/
/cv-service/logs/
/cv-service/.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
/cv-service/models/segmentation_v1/*.png
/cv-service/models/segmentation_v1/*.jpg
/cv-service/models/segmentation_v2/*.png
/cv-service/models/segmentation_v2/*.jpg
/cv-service/models/segmentation_v2/weights/last.pt
/assets/3d_raw/
/assets/3d/accessories/
